{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53788","headline":"重阳日（一无「日」字） · 白居易","name":"重阳日（一无「日」字）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"敬亭山外人归远，峡石溪边水去斜。\n茅屋老妻良酿酒，东篱黄菊任开花。\n（前二句见《千载佳句》卷下《别离部·送别》，後二句见《草木部·菊酒》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53788.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53788","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}